DTEND:20261009T003000Z
SUMMARY:Ty Burr's Film Club: Bringing Up Baby
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:Screwball comedy\, classic Hollywood’s most inspired inventio
 n\, came of age in the years immediately after the Great Depression had tu
 rned everything topsy-turvy\; consequently\, everything feels backward. Th
 e rich are boobs\, the butlers went to Harvard\, dying girls get socked on
  the jaw\, Cary Grant’s a nerd. Screwball inverts the accepted class str
 ucture of American society and turns gender roles inside out\; it rockets 
 along with a cynicism that feels both liberating and earned. And Bringing 
 Up Baby is the most extreme and extremely funny example of the form.\nhttp
 s://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/ty-burrs-film-club-bringing-up-baby\nFr
 om Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/ty-burrs-film-club-bringing-up-b
 aby
END:VEVENT
